      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINTER SURGE (1) settled in the leading division then assumed control and dug deep to score in a 2130m race at Gloucester Park last start, arriving 3.5 metres ahead of his rivals to make it two wins from his past five outings. Likely to get all the favours from this nice draw. Primary contender in a similar race. TEXAS BANNER NZ (6) has had two runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three. Was again unable to find the frame last start when he finished fourth over 2130m at Gloucester Park, beaten 12 metres. This doesn't look as hard so he is sure to prove tough to beat. IDEAL DIAMOND (10) must be considered after she finished runner-up over 2130m at Gloucester Park three weeks ago. MY MACHANE (4) is worth some thought based on his third over 2185m at this track two runs ago.",
